@startuml US010_SSD
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant System

User -> System : Requests daily history for a month and year
System --> User : Displays past daily logs with their meals and logged items
User -> System : Selects a nonempty meal from a previous day to copy
System --> User : Displays the selected meal and asks for today's destination meal
User -> System : Chooses Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner, or Snacks
System --> User : Confirms the meal was copied and displays today's updated meals and nutrition

@enduml
